  expeditionTitle: Ember Reach / Three lamps
  introduction: 'The chart was right: three lamps stand on a broken ridge. Leave
    a safe way for the next walker.'
  surveyObjective: Read the Wind ledger, cross north to the Leeward cairn, then cross
    east and climb to the Keeper's bowl.
  repairObjective: Match 5 Timber crossing cells and 2 Stone steps. Mine wrong materials
    to refund them.
  returnObjective: Stand at the Keeper's bowl on the upper ridge and press F to rekindle
    the three lamps.
  completeObjective: Three lamps burn steady. A route kept for strangers is a home
    offered forward. Keep exploring; F6 resets field notes only.
  initialMessage: Field notes are session-only. F5/F9/F8 store stocks + tiles together.
  interruptedMessage: The ridge route is broken or uses the wrong material. Repair
    it and rekindle at the bowl.
  missingSurveyMessage: Read the ledger, cairn and bowl notes first.
  missingRepairMessage: Restore both Timber crossings and the two matching Stone
    steps.
  alreadyActiveMessage: The three lamps are steady. The ridge is open.
  returnMessage: Reach the Keeper's bowl on foot, then press F.
  successMessage: The keepers left a way home for strangers. Ember Reach is open.
  restartMessage: Field notes reset; route, finite stocks and saved files are kept.
